- `GRIP 0.021 → 0.017`, `HOOK -0.06 → -0.145`; the grip is now a 0.11u cylinder at `+0.075` (starts on the shaft's side of the fist's band), the crook keeps the plan's radius 0.035u / tube 0.012u and hangs past the fist.
- Closed-pose tilt `umb.rotation.set(0.5*e - 0.72*(1-e), 0, (Math.PI+0.06) + e*(Math.PI-0.23))` — it hangs down and toward the learner instead of into her legs (straight-down and out-at-her-side both reintroduced faults).
- Header/inline comments now describe the real band.

